2026-08-15 19:22:55,845 1158257 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': 'Follow `raising`/`ruling`: an append-only `amendment` table storing the text as it was BEFORE the change, then update `defect` in the same transaction so every existing reader keeps working. Amendable fields are `does`, `effect`, `where_`, `confidence` only — identity, ruling, scheduling and sort are refused by name. `why` required, `who` never defaulted. Route `POST /p/<project>/defects/amend`, pre-filled form, export gains `amended:`/`amended_by:`, and `tools/check_amend.py` enters over HTTP rather than calling `db`. Spec: docs/modules/amending-a-defect.md'}
