2026-08-16 08:59:03,139 1202862 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'goal', 'text': 'Give a fixed defect somewhere to go, so the board can show work being finished rather than only accumulating.\n\nPeter, 2026-08-16 07:21: "a never ending list of issue and no light at the end of the tunnel", with the device project already on hold "until I have visibility and control over the project". It was arithmetic, not mood: `accepted` had nothing after it, so the only way a defect could leave the open pile was for Peter to REFUSE it. 70 defects raised, 2 rulings ever made.\n\nGrew during the day, on his prompting, into the three surfaces that answer the goal\'s three requirements: /awaiting (what is outstanding, with a denominator), /state (what is TRUE, unchecked surface first), and the inbox (nothing asked for is lost, in his words).\n\nDone when: a number on a page Peter reads goes down when work is finished, and the page says what is true rather than what is merely recorded.'}
