2026-08-16 08:59:11,986 1202862 DEBUG mcpp.tool CALL plan_task_notes_set args={'kind': 'plan', 'text': '1. `fixed` as a fourth, terminal state, reachable only from `accepted` so nothing is declared done that Peter has not agreed is real. Evidence required and CHECKED: a SHA that resolves via git cat-file in that project\'s own repo. Commit 2af74b4.\n2. /awaiting — every open defect, both projects, ruled inline, with a denominator. 2af74b4.\n3. /state — what is TRUE, unchecked surface leading, summary sentence composed from the numbers rather than written. 43b4c02.\n4. The inbox — Peter\'s words verbatim before anyone classifies them. d2d5de8.\n5. check_drain, then check_live. 8aef8e2, adf9f19.\n6. The overview counting OPEN defects rather than all of them — the miss he caught with "i see no change on the board. still 17 defects". c479e08.\n\nSTEP 4 (OBSERVE, drain the real list WITH PETER) is deliberately left open: I drained one defect and measured both widths, but the part that needs him — ruling the 15 that are his — has not happened and I am not going to mark it as though it had.'}
